---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const jsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  "name": "Terms of Service - ToolsRadar",
  "description": "Terms of Service, acceptable use guidelines, and software disclaimers governing the use of ToolsRadar.",
  "url": "https://lordorange.top/terms"
};
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms of Service - ToolsRadar"
  description="Terms of Service, acceptable use policy, software disclaimers, and legal notices governing access to ToolsRadar."
  canonicalUrl="https://lordorange.top/terms"
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
  <div class="legal-container">
    <header class="legal-header">
      <h1 class="legal-title">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="legal-date">Last Updated: October 12, 2026</p>
      <p class="legal-lead">
        Welcome to <strong>ToolsRadar</strong>. By accessing or using our website, services, directory listings, or technical guides, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by the following Terms of Service.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="legal-body">
      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms of Service ("Terms") constitute a legally binding agreement between you and ToolsRadar ("we", "us", or "our"). If you do not agree to these Terms in their entirety, you must not access or use ToolsRadar. Your continued browsing or utilization of any directory content signifies your unconditional acceptance.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>2. Nature of the Service & Informational Purpose</h2>
        <p>
          ToolsRadar is an independent software intelligence index, directory, and technical review publication. We curate, analyze, summarize, and categorize developer tools, open-source repositories, AI agents, and software utilities.
        </p>
        <p>
          All information provided across our directory pages, comparison tables, and technical guides is provided solely for general informational, educational, and research purposes. We do not provide legal advice regarding intellectual property, regulatory compliance, or enterprise procurement.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>3. Third-Party Software & External Links Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          ToolsRadar catalogs and links to third-party software applications, GitHub repositories, and external web services. Please be advised:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>No Endorsement or Affiliation:</strong> Unless expressly specified, ToolsRadar is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by the creators of listed third-party tools.</li>
          <li><strong>Independent Licenses:</strong> Third-party tools are subject to their own respective licensing agreements (e.g. MIT, Apache 2.0, AGPL, commercial EULAs). It is your sole responsibility to inspect and comply with the applicable license prior to installing or running any software.</li>
          <li><strong>Safety & Code Execution:</strong> While we strive to feature reputable software, we do not inspect every commit or dependency tree of third-party repositories. You assume all responsibility and risk when executing shell scripts, Docker containers, npm packages, or binaries sourced from external projects.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>4. Permitted Use & Prohibited Conduct</h2>
        <p>
          You are permitted to browse, search, bookmark, and share links to ToolsRadar for personal and professional research. You agree not to engage in any of the following prohibited activities:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Using automated scripts, bots, or scrapers to excessively hammer our servers, conduct Denial of Service (DoS) attacks, or disrupt platform infrastructure.</li>
          <li>Attempting to bypass security barriers, rate limits, or reverse-engineer backend APIs.</li>
          <li>Submitting fraudulent tool entries, spam URLs, deceptive affiliate referrals, or malicious software repositories.</li>
          <li>Reproducing our editorial guides and benchmark evaluations in bulk without attribution or written permission.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5 -->
      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>5. Intellectual Property Rights & Fair Use</h2>
        <p>
          The compilation of data, original editorial summaries, custom guide articles, review frameworks, logos, and website code of ToolsRadar are the intellectual property of ToolsRadar and are protected by applicable copyright laws.
        </p>
        <p>
          All third-party trademarks, product names, company names, and logos referenced on ToolsRadar belong to their respective owners. Their display on our website constitutes nominative fair use for identification and review purposes only.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 6 -->
      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>6. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>
          TOOLSRADAR IS PROVIDED ON AN "AS IS" AND "AS AVAILABLE" BASIS, WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, EITHER EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, ACCURACY, TITLE, OR NON-INFRINGEMENT.
        </p>
        <p>
          WE DO NOT WARRANT THAT THE SERVICE WILL BE UNINTERRUPTED, ERROR-FREE, SECURE, OR FREE FROM VIRUSES OR HARMFUL COMPONENTS. YOU USE THE DIRECTORY AND RELY ON ITS CONTENT ENTIRELY AT YOUR OWN RISK.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 7 -->
      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW, IN NO EVENT SHALL TOOLSRADAR, ITS DIRECTORS, MAINTAINERS, CONTRIBUTORS, OR AFFILIATES BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES (INCLUDING LOSS OF PROFITS, DATA LOSS, SERVER DOWNTIME, OR HARDWARE FAILURE) ARISING OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH YOUR ACCESS TO OR INABILITY TO USE THE SERVICE OR ANY THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE FEATURED HEREIN.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 8 -->
      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>8. Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to revise or update these Terms of Service at any time. Any changes will be effective immediately upon posting to this page, with an updated revision date. Your continued use of ToolsRadar following any changes constitutes your binding acceptance of the revised Terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 9 -->
      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>9. Contact & Inquiries</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions, feedback, or legal inquiries concerning these Terms of Service, please contact us:
        </p>
        <div class="contact-box">
          <p><strong>ToolsRadar Legal & Editorial Desk</strong></p>
          <p>Email: <a href="mailto:hello@lordorange.top">hello@lordorange.top</a></p>
          <p>Website: <a href="https://lordorange.top">https://lordorange.top</a></p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-container {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 2rem auto 5rem;
    padding: 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal-header {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding-bottom: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
  }

  .legal-title {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal-date {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .legal-lead {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .legal-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.25rem;
  }

  .legal-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }

  .legal-section p {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .legal-section ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.96rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .contact-box {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .contact-box p {
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .contact-box p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
</style>
